--- stderr ---
Run Axon programs in Firecracker microVMs

Usage: axon-vm <COMMAND>

Commands:
  run        Run an Axon program in a microVM
  principal  Manage principals
  chain      R34: incremental attestation — rolling hash chain over `axon-vm run` invocations
  quorum     R33: cross-VM safety quorum — VoteRequest/Response + strict-majority check
  attest     R26: Measure a kernel image and produce a software-TPM attestation report
  help       Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

